ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Wei is a highly respected painter. His good friend Li Hua, although he loves painting, his skills are average. One day, Li Hua excitedly shows his latest work, asking for Zhang Wei's opinion. Zhang Wei praises the unique color and Li Hua's creativity when he sees this painting.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Zhang Wei say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Wei, out of kindness, does not want to hurt Li Hua's self-esteem. He knows that frankness may dampen Li Hua's enthusiasm and confidence.\nB. Zhang Wei really thinks that Li Hua's work is superb, his praise comes from the heart.\nC. Zhang Wei praises Li Hua because he wants to flatter Li Hua, so he deliberately pleases him.\nD. Zhang Wei hopes to introduce more friends in the art world to him in the future by praising Li Hua's paintings.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694880881607513,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e34bd6006945d2804d41","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368331358,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:38:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2eeecde601b244f6805adb82ecfce59b"}